TI shall lack nothing.
P1
V2
THe makes me lie down in green pastures.
P2
THe leads me beside still waters.
P1
V3
THe restores my soul.
P2
THe guides me in the paths of righteousness for his name’s sake.
P1
V4
TEven though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death,
